+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Validate ``reference_pattern`` in ``AnswerBuilder.run()`` and raise a clear ``ValueError`` when the
+    pattern is invalid, does not contain exactly one capture group, or matches a value that is not a
+    document index. Previously, these cases failed later with cryptic ``int()`` errors when a reply
+    contained a matching reference.
